        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Guilin, Ankang, Guangxi, Shaanxi, China\n- Organizations: Guangxi Normal University, Shanghai International Studies University, University of Toronto, Humboldt-Universitaet zu Berlin\n- People: Niina Ning Zhang\n- Topics: Romanization, prefecture-level cities, universities\n\nFacts:\n- Guilin was formerly romanized as Kweilin.\n- Guilin is a prefecture-level city in northeastern Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region, China.\n- Ankang is a prefecture-level city in southern Shaanxi Province, China.\n- Guangxi Normal University is a university in Guilin, Guangxi, China.\n- Niina Ning Zhang taught linguistic courses at Guangxi Normal University.\n- Niina Ning Zhang taught linguistic courses at Shanghai International Studies University, the University of Toronto, and Humboldt-Universitaet zu Berlin.",
